From: clawd20130 <clawd20130@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:02:16 +0900
Subject: egl/x11: without a DRI3 device only Zink goes on;
 others fall back to software

The branch's Termux:X11 change (b355d4d41a86) makes dri3_x11_connect() report success when
x11_dri3_open() fails, so Zink can go on through kopper. Every other driver then reaches
dri2_initialize_x11_dri3() with the DRI3 image loader extensions but a software screen type,
and drisw_init_screen() dereferences the missing swrast loader. A Flatpak app with only
--device=dri (no /dev/kgsl-3d0 in its sandbox) on an X server without DRI3 crashed in eglInitialize
this way (SIGSEGV in libgallium, drisw_init_screen+0x38). Keep the branch's behaviour for Zink and
return upstream's failure otherwise: eglInitialize then retries with Zink and with the CPU renderer.

Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-09-30
X-Rungic-Status: Pending [a fix of the branch's own change, b355d4d41a86 from termux-packages 411745ec]
X-Rungic-Tests: L3:flatpak.gl-fallback (a Flatpak X11 GL app without /dev/kgsl-3d0 starts on softpipe)
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/49
---
 src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_x11_dri3.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_x11_dri3.c b/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_x11_dri3.c
index 3c5a90a..41a9dbe 100644
--- a/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_x11_dri3.c
+++ b/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_x11_dri3.c
@@ -537,7 +537,10 @@ dri3_x11_connect(struct dri2_egl_display *dri2_dpy, bool swrast)
             _eglLog(_EGL_WARNING, "DRI3: Failed to initialize");
       }
 
-      return true;
+      /* Only Zink goes on without a DRI3 device (the branch's Termux:X11 case). Any other
+       * driver would get a software screen without the swrast loader and crash in
+       * drisw_init_screen: fail, and eglInitialize retries with the CPU renderer. */
+      return dri2_dpy->driver_name && !strcmp(dri2_dpy->driver_name, "zink");
    }
 
    loader_get_user_preferred_fd(&dri2_dpy->fd_render_gpu,
